Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is unbelievable. It's been half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不敢相信 都过了半小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If this was a cartoon, you'd be looking like a ham right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是这是卡通 你到时都变成火腿了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's the waitress. Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}服务生来了 抱歉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Hello, miss? - It's Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 小姐？ - 是菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就点这些吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 你这是干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, um, I was over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then you said, "Excuse me, miss." So now I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后你们说〝抱歉小姐〞 所以我就过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. How come you're working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是啦 你怎么会在这上班
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Because it's close to where I live, and the aprons are really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，因为离我住处近 而且围裙很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从头来一遍好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. Okay, great. I'll be over here. - No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，很好 我回那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E16: The One with Two Parts (A)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》 第一季 第16集：乔伊迷上乌苏拉（上）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:14.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:35.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know whether he's testing me or just acting out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:35.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知是不是在考验我 还是作作样子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but my monkey is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我的猴子真的失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He keeps erasing the messages on my machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是他一直把答录机上的 留言删除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:42.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:45.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Supposedly by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:45.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, I've done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这事我干过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：大卫·肯蓝  玛塔·卡夫曼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And three days in a row, he got to the newspaper before I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连续三天他抢在我前面 拿走报纸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and peed all over the crossword.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在填字游戏上尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这我可没干过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：麦可尔·贝克）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:04.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now tell me she doesn't look exactly like her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:04.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看一眼，跟我说她和她姊姊 长得不像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:06.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm saying I see a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:06.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得不一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们可是双胞胎耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:11.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. Phoebe's Phoebe. Ursula's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:11.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不在乎 菲比是菲比 乌苏拉很辣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know that thing when we talk about things?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们说过的那件事 还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:19.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's not do that anymore. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:19.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要再做了如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, guys. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Pheebs. Guess who we saw today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比 猜今天我们遇到谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh. Oh, fun. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有趣，好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Um, Liam Neeson. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 连恩·尼逊 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Morley Safer. JOEY: Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 莫利·萨佛 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The woman who cuts my hair. JOEY: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我的发型师 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, this could be a really long game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样玩下去没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your sister, Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你姊姊乌苏拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的吗？ - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She works at that place, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在那个地方上班
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Riff's. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞夫餐馆，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you do? She said you guys haven't talked in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道  她说你们好几年 不讲话了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, um, is she fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她胖了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not from where I was standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从我角度来看是没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:55.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where were you standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:55.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是什么角度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:01.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Pheebs, so you guys just don't get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:01.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，你们两个处不来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's mostly just dumb sister stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就一些姊妹间的小事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone always thought of her as the pretty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都说她比较漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Oh. She was the first to walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她也先学会走路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:14.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...even though I did it later that same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我只比她晚几小时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:20.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To my parents, by then it was, "Yeah, what else is new?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:20.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但在我父母眼中 就不稀罕了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, I'm sorry. I've gotta go. I've got Lamaze class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，真抱歉，我要走了 我要上无痛分娩课
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:28.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and I've got earth science, but I'll catch you in gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:28.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要上地球科学课 不过我们健身房见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is this just gonna be you and Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有你和卡萝会去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Susan will be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没，苏珊也会去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've got dads. We've got lesbians. The whole parenting team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老爸、女同志 家长成员都到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, isn't that gonna be weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不会尴尬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. It might have been at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会，一开始或许会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but now I'm comfortable with the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但现在我已经很自在了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross, that's my jacket. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯，那是我的外套  - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. We're the Rostens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是罗斯丹家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:03.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm J.C. And he's Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:03.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是洁西，他是麦可
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we're having a boy and a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怀的是龙凤胎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you. Alrighty, next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厉害，下一对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Um, I'm, uh... Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Ross Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是罗斯盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, uh, that's my boy in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肚子里是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:22.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, uh, this is Carol Willick, and this is Susan Bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:22.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位是卡萝·威利克 这位是苏珊·邦奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:26.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Susan is, um, Carol's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:26.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}苏珊是卡萝的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁是下一对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, Susan is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我没听清楚 苏珊是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Susan is Carol's friend. - Life partner.
