Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:38.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's different. There's, uh, something about her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:38.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她跟别人不同 她有某种特质
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That you like. We get it. You like her. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你迷上她 懂了，你喜欢她，很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Phoebe, I asked you, and you said it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，我事先问过你 你说没意见的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe now it's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但现在有意见了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe now I'm not okay with it not being okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但现在我对你有意见这事 很有意见了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:53.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:53.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Knit, good woman. Knit. Knit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快织，好女人 快织
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's the Chrysler Building right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这边是克莱斯勒大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:16.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}NINA: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:16.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:20.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Nina. - Mr. Douglas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:20.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 妮娜 - 道格拉斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:21.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cool tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:21.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}领带很正
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是，她还在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:30.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't I memo you on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:30.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是有附纸条给你报告过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:35.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, after I let her go, uh, I got a call from her psychiatrist, Dr. Flanen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:35.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开除她后，她的心理医师 法兰医师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:37.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Dr. Flanan, Dr. Flan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:37.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发蓝医师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, uh, he informed me that she took the news rather badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告知我，她对开除一事 适应不良
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, he, uh, mentioned the word "frenzy."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还用了非常激动这样的字眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding. She seems so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少开玩笑了 她明明就很…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no. Nina? She's:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有，妮娜吗？她…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, if you asked her now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是你去问她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she'd have no recollection of being fired at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她对被开除一事 完全没有印象了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太不可置信了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And yet believable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却又很可信
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I decided not to fire her again...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我决定 在确定她不会伤害自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:08.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...until I'm sure she will be of no threat to herself or others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:08.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或其他人之前 不要再开除她一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see. Hmm. You never really know what's going on inside a person's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，人对事情的反应 真的很难预料
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I guess that's why they call it psychology, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以才有心理学吧 老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}NARRATOR [ON TV]: The sound Mom and Dad will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这声音是爸妈都终生难忘的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:27.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For this, after all, is the miracle of birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:27.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟，这是生产的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}TEACHER: Lights, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请开灯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是生产的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Next week is our final class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下一周就是最后一堂课了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:35.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Susan, go deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:35.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}苏珊，往前跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:43.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CAROL: It's impossible. It's just impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:43.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太了不起了 真是太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么东西了不起？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:46.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What that woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:46.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚才那女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:47.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:47.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not doing that. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要经历那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll have to stay in, that's all. Everything will be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要宝宝不生出来就好了 那就一切依旧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It'll just stay in. Ha, ha. - Carol, honey. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 只要不生出来 - 卡萝，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Everything will be all right. - What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 会一切顺利的 - 你懂个屁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one's saying to you, "Hi, is that your nostril?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又不会有人跟你说 那是你的鼻孔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mind if we push this pot roast through it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以把这肉块 从这推出去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Carol, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cleansing breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}深呼吸吐气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know it's frightening. But big picture:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这很吓人 但往想远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The birth part is just one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生产不过是那短短一天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and when it's over, we'll all be parents for the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等生完后，我们这辈子 就成了人家的父母了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:26.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SUSAN: I mean, that's what this is all about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:26.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么辛苦不就是为了这点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对吧，罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:29.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:29.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要当爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:36.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- This is just occurring to you? - I always knew I was having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:36.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你现在才想到吗  - 我是知道会有个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just never realized the baby was having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是一直没想到 孩子也会有我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以办到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:47.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't even get Marcel to stop eating the bathmat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:47.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我连叫马塞尔别吃浴室踏垫 都没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How will I raise a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要怎么养育小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Ross, some scientists are now saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}科学家说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that monkeys and babies are actually different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猴子和小孩是不一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Where are you going? - Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 去哪  - 出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, can I just ask you one question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you two, you know, like, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有那个了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有没
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, not that it's any of your business...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然这不干你事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but no, we haven't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但还没，可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You meant sex, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是指做爱对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:39.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Do you have a sec? - Uh, sure, Nina. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:39.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有空吧 - 有，妮娜，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. For the past couple days, people have been avoiding me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道，过去几天 大家都躲着我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and giving me these really strange looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到我表情都怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:48.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well, uh, maybe that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:48.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔，可能是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they're, uh, jealous of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都嫉妒我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:56.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But that doesn't explain why they keep taking my scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:56.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他们收走剪刀 就说不通了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:19:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, well, maybe that's, uh, because you're getting a big raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:19:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是因为要给你加薪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I am? - Sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有吗？ - 当然，有可能啊
