Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 除了钉书针
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little tip. If you're ever in a similar situation...
